    "introduction": "She began her acting career starring in the feature film \"Contra el demonio\" (Against the Demon), directed by José Miguel Zúñiga. She then embarked on a career path toward professionalizing her craft, studying acting at the Catholic University of Chile. Her career has been intertwined with film, working in productions for companies such as Fábula, Parox, and Oro Films. Highlights include \"El peligro de quererte\" (The Danger of Loving You), starring Katherine Harder, \"Todos los males\" (All Evils), directed by Nicolás Postiglione, and \"La Jauría 2\" (The Pack 2), a Fábula production.She has had a strong career in television, participating in soap operas on the Mega television channel, including series such as \"Edificio Corona,\" \"Pobre novio,\" \"Hijos del Desierto,\" and \"Juego de ilusiones.\"She has always been involved with the arts in general, including painting and dance.",
